				<r3d:description language="eng">This data repository provides access to gravity wave observations of the Atmospheric Infrared Sounder (AIRS) aboard NASA&#039;s Aqua satellite. Information on stratospheric gravity wave activity is derived from radiance measurements in the 4.3 and 15 micron CO2 fundamental bands. The repository provides browse images and netCDF data files for the years 2002 to 2017 and is frequently updated.</r3d:description>
